Package: synaxe-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ca-certificates, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Synaxe public archive key and APT sources
 Enables the main and thirdparty components of the signed Synaxe archive.

Package: synaxe-archive-keyring-private
Architecture: all
Depends: synaxe-archive-keyring (= ${binary:Version}), debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Synaxe private archive access configuration
 Configures authenticated access using APT auth.conf credentials.
 This package contains no credentials or private application code.
